  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-intro frame-box"><p class="lead">I’m Muhammad Fahad Siddiqui, a Frankfurt-based full-stack engineer who likes understanding the complete system—not only the layer currently on fire.</p><p>I build product experiences, backend services and delivery infrastructure, and I’m increasingly applying LLM and retrieval patterns where they solve a real user problem. I care about calm execution, explicit trade-offs and software that stays operable.</p><div class="availability"><i></i><span>Available for full-time opportunities<br>and selected freelance engagements.</span></div></div>
